OL,3,GNEWSARomance in the air for safari
OL,4,Apark's porcupines
OL,5,
OL,6,FZookeepers are hoping to see baby
OL,7,Fporcupines - known as a porcupettes -
OL,8,Ffollowing the arrival of Gus, a male
OL,9,Fprehensile-tailed porcupine.
OL,11,FLongleat Safari Park, located between
OL,12,FBath and Salisbury, has welcomed Gus
OL,13,F(short for Asparagus), who they hope
OL,14,Fwill spark up a romance with their
OL,15,Ffemale porcupine, Pumpkin.
OL,17,FThe park currently has three species of
OL,18,Fporcupine, with Gus being their first
OL,19,Fmale prehensile-tailed porcupine, also
OL,20,Fknown as the Brazilian porcupine.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
