OL,3,GNEWSARomance in the air for safari
OL,4,Apark's porcupines
OL,5,
OL,6,FJon Ovens, the lead keeper, said: "It
OL,7,Fwas lovely to see them getting on from
OL,8,Fthe first moment of meeting so we will
OL,9,Fbe keeping an eye on them but the
OL,10,Faverage pregnancy is around 200 days so
OL,11,Fwe have some time to wait."
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
